I walk to Nele's desk.
We are finally working closely together for this project.
I need the new pictures and designs for our work.
"Hello Maya, please sit down", says Nele.
She is the UI designer on our team.
We talk a bit about our professions.
"I have already worked here for five years", she explains.
We look at her large monitor together.
She has already made many layouts today.
"I have already designed these three pages", she says.
She shows me the finished drafts.
"But I have not finished the start page yet", she explains.
"That all looks really great", I answer.
"I can simply start with the first three pages."
I now write the code for it.
Nele sends me the documents by email.
I thank her.
Then I go back to my seat.
